                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Great unique game\n\nThe concept of building a space ship and drive it with food is a funny idea. Loading the rocket can be really challenging and fun. Graphics are whimsical and cute and the music fits perfectly to the game play. It’s just fun building space ships in this nice game. Looking forward to seeing more planets. A big plus is that the developers seem to really care; they responded to my bug report with a fix right away.",
